# Alembic Migrations — SDMAS v2

This directory contains database migration scripts managed by Alembic.

## Current Status

- Alembic is configured for async SQLAlchemy.
- The `versions/` directory is intentionally empty.
- No domain migrations have been created yet (Phase 1 — Foundation only).
- Domain migrations (Student, Academic, Attendance, Fees) will be added in later phases.

## Usage

```bash
# Create a new migration
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description"

# Apply pending migrations
alembic upgrade head

# Roll back one migration
alembic downgrade -1

# View migration history
alembic history
```

**Warning:** Do not run domain migrations until the domain models have been implemented in a later phase.